      "after": [
        "The policy allows two read actions on four namespace trees, and one write action on Dana's proposals only. It has no delete action.",
        "The coordinator runs the apply step with the admin login after Alice says yes. The step creates the IAM user, the inline policy and one access key. It writes the key into a private file and never prints it."
      ]
    },
